            "review_title": "Review at SAIGON Kitchen & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Deralm\nBeach City, TX47 contributions\n0\nManager is terrible\nAug 2019\nManager is terrible. The men will pick their nose and then remove the plastic wrap from my straw and handle with their uncleaned hands (vomit)! They gave me such a small amount of sauce with my chicken cordon blue that I ask for a little more, they charged 25,000. This restaurant is terrible, but the owner has another at Park 1 that is acceptable. Stay away because they told me the owner cannot change things, only the terrible manager. Said the 25,000 was such a small amount. They must be desperate to say this. Also don't expect your food with your guest. I was served mine and 15 minutes later my guest was served her Salmon. I said my food is cold now since I had to wait for my guest to receive their food. They thought I was crazy. Not an upper scale restaurant that you would expect in Vinhomes.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2019",
